      `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the AI system related to products covered by the Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I? Answer no if you do not know of such legislation.
      `Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lays down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights as the requirement or obligation concerned` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lay down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights than the requirement or obligation this question is about? Answer no if you do not know of such legislation.
      `such limitation does not reduce the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Would limiting the application of the requirement or obligation this question is about leave the overall level of protection provided by this Regulation undiminished? Answer no if you do not know.
      `the technical documentation contains a detailed description of the system in place to evaluate the AI system performance in the post-market phase in accordance with Article 72` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For the technical documentation you have been given, is it the case that the technical documentation contains a detailed description of the system in place to evaluate the AI system performance in the post-market phase in accordance with Article 72?
      `the technical documentation contains the post-market monitoring plan referred to in Article 72(3)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For the technical documentation you have been given, is it the case that the technical documentation contains the post-market monitoring plan referred to in Article 72(3)?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Annex IV point 9, as a notified body, does the technical documentation I was given contain a detailed description of the system in place to evaluate the performance of the AI system in the post-market phase, including the post-market monitoring plan` IS
    `Annex IV point 9 the technical documentation contains a detailed description of the post-market evaluation system and the monitoring plan` `the date asked` `the AI system as stated` `the harmonisation facts as stated` `the technical documentation contains a detailed description of the system in place to evaluate the AI system performance in the post-market phase in accordance with Article 72` `the technical documentation contains the post-market monitoring plan referred to in Article 72(3)`
    WHERE
        `the AI system as stated` MEANS `AI system` WITH
            `date placed on the market or put into service` IS `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service`
            `route` IS `the route by which the AI system is high-risk`
            `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III`
        `the harmonisation facts as stated` MEANS `Arts 8 to 15 harmonisation facts` WITH
            `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I`
            `Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lays down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights as the requirement or obligation concerned` IS `Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lays down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights as the requirement or obligation concerned`
            `such limitation does not reduce the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation` IS `such limitation does not reduce the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation`

@export Under Annex IV, as a notified body, does the technical documentation I was given contain at least the information Annex IV lists in each of its nine points?
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE @desc On what date do you want the answer? Give today's date for the Regulation as it stands today, or an earlier or later date for the Regulation as it stood or will stand then.
      `the route by which the AI system is high-risk` IS A `Route to high-risk` @desc Is the AI system high-risk because of Article 6(1) with Annex I, because of Article 6(2) with Annex III, or neither?
      `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` IS A DATE @desc On what date was the AI system first placed on the market or put into service in the Union? If that has not happened yet, give the date you expect.
      `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Since the date from which Chapter III of the Regulation applies to your AI system, has its design been significantly changed? Answer no if you do not know of a significant change.
      `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the AI system related to products covered by the Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I? Answer no if you do not know of such legislation.
      `Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lays down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights as the requirement or obligation concerned` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lay down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights than the requirement or obligation this question is about? Answer no if you do not know of such legislation.
      `such limitation does not reduce the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Would limiting the application of the requirement or obligation this question is about leave the overall level of protection provided by this Regulation undiminished? Answer no if you do not know.
      `the technical documentation contains the information of point 1 of Annex IV` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the technical documentation contain the information of point 1 of Annex IV, a general description of the AI system? Answer from the questions asked about point 1.
      `the technical documentation contains the information of point 2 of Annex IV` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the technical documentation contain the information of point 2 of Annex IV, a detailed description of the elements of the AI system and of the process for its development? Answer from the questions asked about point 2.
      `the technical documentation contains the information of point 3 of Annex IV` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the technical documentation contain the information of point 3 of Annex IV, detailed information about the monitoring, functioning and control of the AI system? Answer from the questions asked about point 3.
      `the technical documentation contains the information of point 4 of Annex IV` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the technical documentation contain the information of point 4 of Annex IV, a description of the appropriateness of the performance metrics? Answer from the questions asked about point 4.
      `the technical documentation contains the information of point 5 of Annex IV` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the technical documentation contain the information of point 5 of Annex IV, a detailed description of the risk management system? Answer from the questions asked about point 5.
      `the technical documentation contains the information of point 6 of Annex IV` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the technical documentation contain the information of point 6 of Annex IV, a description of relevant changes made by the provider? Answer from the questions asked about point 6.
      `the technical documentation contains the information of point 7 of Annex IV` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the technical documentation contain the information of point 7 of Annex IV, a list of the harmonised standards applied or a description of the solutions adopted? Answer from the questions asked about point 7.
      `the technical documentation contains the information of point 8 of Annex IV` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the technical documentation contain the information of point 8 of Annex IV, a copy of the EU declaration of conformity? Answer from the questions asked about point 8.
      `the technical documentation contains the information of point 9 of Annex IV` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the technical documentation contain the information of point 9 of Annex IV, a detailed description of the post-market evaluation system and the monitoring plan? Answer from the questions asked about point 9.
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Annex IV, as a notified body, does the technical documentation I was given contain at least the information Annex IV lists in each of its nine points` IS
    `Annex IV the technical documentation contains at least the following information` `the date asked` `the AI system as stated` `the harmonisation facts as stated` (LIST JUST `the technical documentation contains the information of point 1 of Annex IV`, JUST `the technical documentation contains the information of point 2 of Annex IV`, JUST `the technical documentation contains the information of point 3 of Annex IV`, JUST `the technical documentation contains the information of point 4 of Annex IV`, JUST `the technical documentation contains the information of point 5 of Annex IV`, JUST `the technical documentation contains the information of point 6 of Annex IV`, JUST `the technical documentation contains the information of point 7 of Annex IV`, JUST `the technical documentation contains the information of point 8 of Annex IV`, JUST `the technical documentation contains the information of point 9 of Annex IV`)
    WHERE
        `the AI system as stated` MEANS `AI system` WITH
            `date placed on the market or put into service` IS `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service`
            `route` IS `the route by which the AI system is high-risk`
            `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III`
        `the harmonisation facts as stated` MEANS `Arts 8 to 15 harmonisation facts` WITH
            `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I`
            `Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lays down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights as the requirement or obligation concerned` IS `Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lays down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights as the requirement or obligation concerned`
            `such limitation does not reduce the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation` IS `such limitation does not reduce the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation`

