    JUST (`Annex VII the group of Article 43 applies to the AI system on the date asked` `the date asked` `the route by which the AI system is high-risk` `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III`)

§ `Article 28: Notifying authorities`

-- Article 28(8): the layer-1 function `Art 28(8) first subparagraph the notifying authority has ensured the single application and the unified assessment`
@export Under Article 28(8), as a notified body, has the notifying authority ensured that I can submit a single application and undergo a unified assessment procedure?
