      `the relevant Union harmonisation legislation provides for such a single application and unified assessment procedure` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the relevant Union harmonisation legislation provides for such a single application and unified assessment procedure?
      `the body is provided with the possibility to submit a single application` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the body is provided with the possibility to submit a single application?
      `the body undergoes a unified assessment procedure` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the body undergoes a unified assessment procedure?
      `the notifying authorities cooperate in their assessments` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the notifying authorities cooperate in their assessments?
