    `Art 28(8) first subparagraph the notifying authority has ensured the single application and the unified assessment` `the date asked` `the notifying authority designated pursuant to this Regulation is responsible for AI systems covered by the Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I` `the conformity assessment body applies for designation both pursuant to this Regulation and the Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I` `the relevant Union harmonisation legislation provides for such a single application and unified assessment procedure` `the body is provided with the possibility to submit a single application` `the body undergoes a unified assessment procedure` `the notifying authorities cooperate in their assessments`

