    `Art 28(8) second subparagraph the single application and the unified assessment are made available to a notified body already designated` `the date asked` `the body is a notified body already designated pursuant to the Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I` `the notified body applies for designation pursuant to this Regulation` `the relevant Union harmonisation legislation provides for such a procedure` `the single application and the unified assessment procedure are made available to the notified body`

